  "prefLabel": "Rev 1505.01 Exceptions and Penalty for the Underpayment of Estimated Tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1505.01 Exceptions and Penalty for the Underpayment of Estimated Tax. A taxpayer, who has underpaid their estimated tax, shall complete and file Form DP-2210/2220, “Exceptions and Penalty for the Underpayment of Estimated Tax”, by providing the information as described in Rev 2905.02.\n\nSource. #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
